# EAS / Play Store credentials
play-store-service-account.json

# NOTE: google-services.json is intentionally NOT ignored.
# EAS Build requires it at the path referenced in app.json (android.googleServicesFile).
# The Firebase API key inside it is restricted by Android app-signing SHA-1,
# so committing it is the standard Expo/EAS approach and poses minimal risk.

